<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>The Flow of Remembrance | Justin Mishra</title>
    
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #000000;
            --card-bg: #050505;
            --border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
            --text-primary: #F2F2F2;
            --text-secondary: #888888;
            --font-main: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
            --radius-lg: 24px;
            --radius-full: 100px;
        }

        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }
        img, video { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

        /* Vibe Enablers */
        .noise-overlay {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh;
            pointer-events: none; z-index: 9999; opacity: 0.04;
            background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)'/%3E%3C/svg%3E");
        }
        
        .ambient-glow {
            position: fixed; top: 0; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 80vw; height: 50vw;
            background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 70%);
            filter: blur(80px); z-index: -1; pointer-events: none;
        }

        /* Navigation (Same as Home) */
        nav {
            position: fixed; top: 24px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
            background: rgba(5, 5, 5, 0.7); backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            padding: 12px 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 32px; z-index: 1000;
        }
        .nav-logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
        .nav-links a { font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 500; color: var(--text-secondary); transition: color 0.3s; }
        .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }
        .nav-btn { background: var(--text-primary); color: var(--bg-color); padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; transition: transform 0.2s; }
        .nav-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.05); }

        /* Project Hero */
        .project-hero {
            padding: 12rem 5% 4rem;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .back-link {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
            color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;
            transition: color 0.3s;
        }
        .back-link:hover { color: var(--text-primary); }

        .project-title {
            font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 7rem);
            font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        .project-meta {
            display: flex; gap: 4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 4rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .meta-item span { display: block; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 0.85rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .meta-item p { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 500; }

        /* Main Video Container */
        .hero-media {
            width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 16/9;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            margin-bottom: 6rem;
        }

        /* Project Brief Layout */
        .project-content {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr; gap: 4rem;
            max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 8rem; padding: 0 5%;
        }
        .project-content h2 { font-size: 2rem; font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-secondary); }
        .project-content p { font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--text-primary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

        /* Gallery Grid */
        .gallery-grid {
            display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 16px;
            max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto 8rem; padding: 0 24px;
        }
        .gallery-item {
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }
        .gallery-item.full { grid-column: span 2; aspect-ratio: 21/9; }
        .gallery-item.half { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }

        /* Next Project Footer */
        .next-project {
            padding: 8rem 5%; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            display: block; transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        .next-project:hover { background: var(--card-bg); }
        .next-project span { display: block; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        .next-project h2 { font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 8rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.04em; }

        /* Scroll Animations */
        .fade-up { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px); transition: opacity 0.8s ease, transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1); }
        .fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

        @media (max-width: 900px) {
            .project-content { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
            .gallery-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .gallery-item.full, .gallery-item.half { grid-column: span 1; aspect-ratio: auto; height: 50vh; }
            .nav-links { display: none; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="noise-overlay"></div>
    <div class="ambient-glow"></div>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">JM.</a>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="index.html#work">Work</a>
            <a href="index.html#about">About</a>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:hello@justinmishra.com" class="nav-btn">Let's Talk</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="project-hero">
        <a href="index.html" class="back-link fade-up">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="19" y1="12" x2="5" y2="12"></line><polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline></svg>
            Back to Home
        </a>
        
        <h1 class="project-title fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">The Flow of<br>Remembrance</h1>
        
        <div class="project-meta fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.2s;">
            <div class="meta-item"><span>Role</span><p>Director / DP</p></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><span>Category</span><p>Short Film</p></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><span>Year</span><p>2024</p></div>
            <div class="meta-item"><span>Location</span><p>Delhi, India</p></div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-media fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.3s;">
            <!-- Main Project Video -->
            <video autoplay loop muted playsinline>
                <source src="https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4" type="video/mp4">
            </video>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-content">
        <div class="fade-up">
            <h2>The Approach</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
            <p>This project was born out of a desire to capture the subtle, unspoken moments between major life events. We utilized natural light and minimal rigging to allow the subjects to move freely through the space.</p>
            <p>By treating the camera as an observer rather than a participant, we crafted a visual language that feels deeply intimate and quietly cinematic.</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="gallery-grid">
        <div class="gallery-item full fade-up">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1492691527719-9d1e07e534b4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1600&q=80" alt="Behind the scenes">
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item half fade-up">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1511285560929-80b456fea0bc?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Cinematic Still">
        </div>
        <div class="gallery-item half fade-up" style="transition-delay: 0.1s;">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547153760-18fc86324498?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="Choreography setup">
        </div>
    </section>

    <a href="#" class="next-project fade-up">
        <span>Next Project</span>
        <h2>Unscripted</h2>
    </a>

    <script>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
                entries.forEach(entry => {
                    if (entry.isIntersecting) {
                        entry.target.classList.add('visible');
                    }
                });
            }, { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: "0px 0px -50px 0px" });

            document.querySelectorAll('.fade-up').forEach((el) => { observer.observe(el); });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
